  - org.dxos.spec.qa
  - org.dxos.spec.sql
---

The software dialect: the one dialect a software project's specs use. It declares no blocks of its
own; it takes the feature map, app, code, plugin, QA and storage dialects together, so a spec names
one dialect and tools offer one set of views and slash commands for it.
